{"id":4456,"date":"2025-06-26T16:12:44","date_gmt":"2025-06-26T16:12:44","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=4456"},"modified":"2025-08-11T04:06:20","modified_gmt":"2025-08-11T04:06:20","slug":"cach-dang-ky-thuong-hieu-tren-shopee","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/tin-tuc\/cach-dang-ky-thuong-hieu-tren-shopee\/","title":{"rendered":"C\u00e1ch \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u tr\u00ean Shopee t\u1eeb A &#8211; Z cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi m\u1edbi"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"MIZndTTJzodYkbxbIj5lYaJRgvc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tz1mdGkCjodKSdxJluGl1e4UgCf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u0103ng k\u00fd th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u tr\u00ean Shopee gi\u00fap b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ch\u00ednh h\u00e3ng, t\u0103ng uy t\u00edn gian h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u01b0u ti\u00ean hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 b\u01b0\u1edbc quan tr\u1ecdng n\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n kinh doanh l\u00e2u d\u00e0i v\u00e0 x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng TM\u0110T n\u00e0y. C\u00f9ng <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/strong> t\u00ecm hi\u1ec3u c\u00e1ch \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd nhanh ch\u00f3ng!<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AgfYdrErpopAz4xKzfpl7qCsgCb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-EreTdmiLFomn22x1OAwlt9Pbgfc\" style=\"text-align: left;\">1. \u0110\u0103ng k\u00fd th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u tr\u00ean Shopee l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M7fTdQELbod6fxx9E2llKHQYgJd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u0103ng k\u00fd th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u tr\u00ean Shopee l\u00e0 qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh m\u00e0 nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng ch\u1ee9ng minh quy\u1ec1n s\u1edf h\u1eefu th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u \u0111\u1ed1i v\u1edbi s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111ang kinh doanh, nh\u1eb1m b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 b\u1ea3n quy\u1ec1n, t\u0103ng uy t\u00edn, v\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c h\u01b0\u1edfng c\u00e1c \u0111\u1eb7c quy\u1ec1n t\u1eeb s\u00e0n.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HPhCdYUy1oY8K6xoBiPlSHamgQf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng, th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c g\u1eafn nh\u00e3n \u201cTh\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u ch\u00ednh h\u00e3ng\u201d tr\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m. Ngo\u00e0i ra, Shopee c\u0169ng \u01b0u ti\u00ean hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb, h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 ch\u1ed1ng h\u00e0ng gi\u1ea3 v\u00e0 c\u1ea5p quy\u1ec1n s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng Trung t\u00e2m b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u (Brand Protection Platform).<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T3fpdnqEyoZEgdx9wF4lPr42g1f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_4382\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4382\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4382\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/40-1.png\" alt=\"\u0110\u0103ng k\u00fd th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u tr\u00ean Shopee gi\u00fap x\u00e1c minh v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 nh\u00e3n hi\u1ec7u c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n. \" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/40-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/40-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/40-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/40-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/40-1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4382\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">\u0110\u0103ng k\u00fd th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u tr\u00ean Shopee gi\u00fap x\u00e1c minh v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 nh\u00e3n hi\u1ec7u c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"MIZndTTJzodYkbxbIj5lYaJRgvc\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-SlJSdZc8Qo9SDKx8BXZlEW1qgff\" style=\"text-align: left;\">2. L\u1ee3i \u00edch c\u1ee7a vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u<\/h2>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>1. B\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 quy\u1ec1n s\u1edf h\u1eefu tr\u00ed tu\u1ec7 m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch ch\u00ednh th\u1ed1ng<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XjACd3b8xoBO8Cx0bnYlBz7kgmd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c tr\u00ean Shopee, \u0111i\u1ec1u \u0111\u00f3 \u0111\u1ed3ng ngh\u0129a v\u1edbi vi\u1ec7c b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 quy\u1ec1n ph\u00e1p l\u00fd r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng v\u1edbi s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, logo v\u00e0 t\u00ean th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u. Nh\u1edd \u0111\u00f3, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 ch\u1ee7 \u0111\u1ed9ng b\u00e1o c\u00e1o, y\u00eau c\u1ea7u x\u1eed l\u00fd c\u00e1c gian h\u00e0ng \u0111ang vi ph\u1ea1m quy\u1ec1n s\u1edf h\u1eefu tr\u00ed tu\u1ec7 nh\u01b0 sao ch\u00e9p n\u1ed9i dung, h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh, b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng nh\u00e1i. Shopee c\u0169ng cung c\u1ea5p c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 ri\u00eang l\u00e0 Trung t\u00e2m B\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 Th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u (Brand Protection Platform) \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1ea1n ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t v\u00e0 b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 h\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-UASHdBzA3oOywkxV0kAl0yIMg1f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"divider\"><strong>2. T\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed9 uy t\u00edn, t\u1ea1o ni\u1ec1m tin v\u1edbi kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-O634dI2z7oRpH2xbCSKl2pU8gqh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">M\u1ed9t th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u00e1c minh tr\u00ean Shopee s\u1ebd hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb nh\u00e3n \u201cTh\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u ch\u00ednh h\u00e3ng\u201d ho\u1eb7c c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh gian h\u00e0ng Shopee Mall n\u1ebfu \u0111\u00e1p \u1ee9ng th\u00eam c\u00e1c ti\u00eau ch\u00ed kh\u00e1c. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y khi\u1ebfn kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng d\u1ec5 nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n v\u00e0 tin t\u01b0\u1edfng h\u01a1n v\u00e0o s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m b\u1ea1n b\u00e1n, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t l\u00e0 trong b\u1ed1i c\u1ea3nh ng\u01b0\u1eddi ti\u00eau d\u00f9ng ng\u00e0y c\u00e0ng quan t\u00e2m \u0111\u1ebfn ngu\u1ed3n g\u1ed1c v\u00e0 ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-I6CXdpblPoF336xEGWbl1QKEgJN\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"divider\"><strong>3. \u0110\u01b0\u1ee3c Shopee \u01b0u ti\u00ean hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb v\u00e0 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 marketing<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WxKLdvnkIoIsN2xySFElfSB5gFf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Shopee c\u00f3 xu h\u01b0\u1edbng \u01b0u ti\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m t\u1eeb c\u00e1c th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u \u0111\u00e3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u00e1c minh trong k\u1ebft qu\u1ea3 t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm, trong c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh khuy\u1ebfn m\u00e3i l\u1edbn ho\u1eb7c khi ch\u1ecdn l\u1ecdc \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c tham gia c\u00e1c chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch do s\u00e0n t\u1ed5 ch\u1ee9c. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y t\u1ea1o \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ec3 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn \u0111\u1ebfn nhi\u1ec1u kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng h\u01a1n m\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i chi th\u00eam nhi\u1ec1u chi ph\u00ed qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o.<\/div>\n<div data-type=\"divider\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-QsRKdqEgwodiONx9cFwlVVxfgSB\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"divider\"><strong>4. C\u01a1 h\u1ed9i tham gia ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh \u0111\u1ed9c quy\u1ec1n v\u00e0 s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n l\u1edbn<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VbR1d1xTNoNYAexKG0FliYGigvh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u c\u00f2n l\u00e0 \u201ct\u1ea5m v\u00e9\u201d \u0111\u1ec3 b\u1ea1n tham gia c\u00e1c ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh d\u00e0nh ri\u00eang cho th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u nh\u01b0 Shopee Mall Brand Day, chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi Shopee, Flash Sale Th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u,&#8230; \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 nh\u1eefng d\u1ecbp th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd doanh thu v\u00e0 qu\u1ea3ng b\u00e1 th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u tr\u00ean di\u1ec7n r\u1ed9ng.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-OvEXdABtyoGifBxMN5dlqc62gAd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"divider\"><strong>5. T\u0103ng kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EORJdS2iXoPWIkxGIoFloCm2gCI\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u0103ng k\u00fd th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 l\u00e0 h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 hi\u1ec7n t\u1ea1i m\u00e0 c\u00f2n l\u00e0 b\u01b0\u1edbc chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb chi\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3c d\u00e0i h\u1ea1n. Khi b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng sang c\u00e1c n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng kh\u00e1c, ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n k\u00eanh b\u00e1n l\u1ebb, h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c \u0111\u1ea1i l\u00fd hay g\u1ecdi v\u1ed1n, th\u00ec vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u00e3 s\u1edf h\u1eefu th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng gi\u00fap t\u0103ng gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed9 tin c\u1eady cho doanh nghi\u1ec7p c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4381\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4381\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4381\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/39-1.png\" alt=\"B\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, t\u0103ng uy t\u00edn v\u00e0 ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t n\u1ed9i dung. \" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/39-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/39-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/39-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/39-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/39-1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4381\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">B\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, t\u0103ng uy t\u00edn v\u00e0 ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t n\u1ed9i dung.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YTI1dtXfeo2VKmxuygQlKi7QgEd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-S805dtMrZokvkCx03xslBZfGgVf\" style=\"text-align: left;\">3. \u0110i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G4q6ddUOPo0URHxtALBlajZdgee\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ec3 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u tr\u00ean Shopee, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n:<\/div>\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" start=\"1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QdFmdSDpVoqFUZx6Jq5lKXGggGb\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>Gi\u1ea5y ch\u1ee9ng nh\u1eadn \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd nh\u00e3n hi\u1ec7u (do C\u1ee5c SHTT c\u1ea5p).<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TiQgdh2WOoTlxlx871SlRutmgk6\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>Gi\u1ea5y t\u1edd x\u00e1c minh l\u00e0 ch\u1ee7 s\u1edf h\u1eefu ho\u1eb7c c\u00f3 \u1ee7y quy\u1ec1n ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RMvWdtmPZocLc3xPwe4lDJgGgTe\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>Logo, t\u00ean th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng, nh\u1ea5t qu\u00e1n tr\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZPrGdAaodorqXJxr3KllDmCqgUh\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div>Gian h\u00e0ng ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng h\u1ee3p l\u1ec7, th\u00f4ng tin \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VB47dx3yao5TpsxJckKlQqkzgAd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb \u0111\u1ee7 h\u1ed3 s\u01a1 gi\u00fap b\u1ea1n nhanh ch\u00f3ng x\u00e1c minh th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u v\u00e0 h\u01b0\u1edfng nhi\u1ec1u \u0111\u1eb7c quy\u1ec1n tr\u00ean Shopee.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KagddzBncoh2cNxWTVOlubcrg6x\" style=\"text-align: left;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-Rvzxd06VMogyu5xqtxol1ng2gIg\" style=\"text-align: left;\">4. Quy tr\u00ecnh \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u tr\u00ean Shopee<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PgzZdeEn4oS5yGxD2TOlBmDHgjd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: <\/strong>Chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb h\u1ed3 s\u01a1 G\u1ed3m: gi\u1ea5y ch\u1ee9ng nh\u1eadn \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd nh\u00e3n hi\u1ec7u, CMND\/CCCD ho\u1eb7c gi\u1ea5y ph\u00e9p kinh doanh, h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ed3ng \u1ee7y quy\u1ec1n (n\u1ebfu kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i ch\u1ee7 s\u1edf h\u1eefu).<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W7ZGdw2nWo6BK5xQcK4lOi77gUd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: <\/strong>\u0110\u0103ng nh\u1eadp v\u00e0o Trung t\u00e2m Ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n (Shopee Seller Center) Ch\u1ecdn m\u1ee5c Y\u00eau c\u1ea7u x\u00e1c minh th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u t\u1ea1i ph\u1ea7n Qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IH8fdYeZ0oSeVAxJkQXlQ867gNg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: <\/strong>\u0110i\u1ec1n th\u00f4ng tin v\u00e0 t\u1ea3i t\u00e0i li\u1ec7u l\u00ean Nh\u1eadp t\u00ean th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, m\u00f4 t\u1ea3, ch\u1ecdn ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 t\u1ea3i c\u00e1c gi\u1ea5y t\u1edd c\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft theo y\u00eau c\u1ea7u c\u1ee7a Shopee.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UDeGdpAWUoirAjxxKtnlNgOKg7f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>B\u01b0\u1edbc 4: <\/strong>G\u1eedi y\u00eau c\u1ea7u v\u00e0 ch\u1edd x\u00e9t duy\u1ec7t Shopee s\u1ebd x\u00e9t duy\u1ec7t trong v\u00f2ng 7\u201314 ng\u00e0y l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c. N\u1ebfu \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ch\u1ea5p thu\u1eadn, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c th\u00f4ng b\u00e1o qua email.<\/div>\n<div data-type=\"divider\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-MeOQdBN63oHLOsx7UgNluxXjgce\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"divider\">Sau khi \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u00e1c minh, th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u s\u1ebd hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb nh\u00e3n \u201cCh\u00ednh h\u00e3ng\u201d tr\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c h\u01b0\u1edfng nhi\u1ec1u quy\u1ec1n l\u1ee3i \u01b0u ti\u00ean t\u1eeb Shopee.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UC8NdlH5OojnQCxMs3XlEn5yglu\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-KM5admDjIoy9Ksx28Dnl7Vktgsf\" style=\"text-align: left;\">5. Chi ph\u00ed li\u00ean quan v\u00e0 th\u1eddi gian x\u1eed l\u00fd<\/h2>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-SCpVdA48eoWj0lxfslulyoj4gYe\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>5.1. Chi ph\u00ed \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u tr\u00ean Shopee<\/strong><\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WaxjdykXSoJqOzxa8kRlklyngnf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>L\u1ec7 ph\u00ed \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd nh\u00e3n hi\u1ec7u t\u1ea1i C\u1ee5c S\u1edf h\u1eefu Tr\u00ed tu\u1ec7:<\/strong> kho\u1ea3ng t\u1eeb 1 tri\u1ec7u \u0111\u1ebfn 3 tri\u1ec7u \u0111\u1ed3ng cho m\u1ed7i nh\u00f3m s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m\/ d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd. C\u1ee5 th\u1ec3 c\u00e1c kho\u1ea3n ph\u00ed bao g\u1ed3m l\u1ec7 ph\u00ed n\u1ed9p \u0111\u01a1n, ph\u00ed c\u00f4ng b\u1ed1 \u0111\u01a1n, ph\u00ed tra c\u1ee9u th\u00f4ng tin v\u00e0 ph\u00ed th\u1ea9m \u0111\u1ecbnh \u0111\u01a1n (v\u00ed d\u1ee5: l\u1ec7 ph\u00ed n\u1ed9p \u0111\u01a1n 75.000 \u0111\u1ed3ng, ph\u00ed c\u00f4ng b\u1ed1 120.000 \u0111\u1ed3ng, ph\u00ed th\u1ea9m \u0111\u1ecbnh 550.000 \u0111\u1ed3ng\/ nh\u00f3m s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Chi ph\u00ed c\u00f4ng ch\u1ee9ng\/h\u1ee3p ph\u00e1p h\u00f3a gi\u1ea5y t\u1edd (n\u1ebfu c\u00f3)<\/strong><\/li>\n<li>Ngo\u00e0i ra Lemon Digital c\u00f3 d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n v\u00e0 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u tr\u1ecdn g\u00f3i cho b\u1ea1n, chi ph\u00ed v\u00e0o kho\u1ea3ng 5 tri\u1ec7u \u0111\u1ed3ng b\u1ea1n. Li\u00ean h\u1ec7 ngay s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: 0938785735 \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-U0wHdSD20o9Aaex7wLTltAGAgYd\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>5.2. Th\u1eddi gian x\u1eed l\u00fd<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QF1IdHEGtonkTaxP9WNlRCY5ggf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">X\u00e9t duy\u1ec7t x\u00e1c minh th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u tr\u00ean Shopee: kho\u1ea3ng 7 \u2013 14 ng\u00e0y l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WMSsdaWFFo1ARpxTi7almw99gpf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u0103ng k\u00fd nh\u00e3n hi\u1ec7u t\u1ea1i C\u1ee5c SHTT (n\u1ebfu ch\u01b0a c\u00f3): t\u1eeb 12 \u2013 18 th\u00e1ng \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u1ea5p gi\u1ea5y ch\u1ee9ng nh\u1eadn (c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 nhanh h\u01a1n n\u1ebfu s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p).<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4457\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4457\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4457\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/60-1.png\" alt=\"Chi ph\u00ed li\u00ean quan v\u00e0 th\u1eddi gian x\u1eed l\u00fd - T\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 7 ng\u00e0y l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/60-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/60-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/60-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/60-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/60-1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4457\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Chi ph\u00ed li\u00ean quan v\u00e0 th\u1eddi gian x\u1eed l\u00fd &#8211; T\u1ed1i thi\u1ec3u 7 ng\u00e0y l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AbiWda4BhosB2kxfZC3lHPO2gyc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-LkILdFmCvo3Y8Vx7iw9ltwUxgid\" style=\"text-align: left;\">6. L\u01b0u \u00fd khi \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UF6Idv0kHo3dncxE8UDl7vPVgMd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">D\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 ph\u1ea7n <strong>6 l\u01b0u \u00fd khi \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u tr\u00ean Shopee<\/strong>:<\/div>\n<ol class=\"list-number1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" start=\"1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PrcbdV18qo3lP2xweqOlf1wVgfg\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>Gi\u1ea5y ch\u1ee9ng nh\u1eadn nh\u00e3n hi\u1ec7u ph\u1ea3i h\u1ee3p l\u1ec7<\/strong> v\u00e0 \u0111\u00fang t\u00ean th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IF4Zdprico7Qfwx39tAl7ec3gTd\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>Th\u00f4ng tin th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u ph\u1ea3i \u0111\u1ed3ng nh\u1ea5t<\/strong> tr\u00ean h\u1ed3 s\u01a1 v\u00e0 gian h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jrqgd2qfroSkk7xlbZble2tbgif\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Shopee \u0111ang ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng b\u00ecnh th\u01b0\u1eddng<\/strong>, kh\u00f4ng vi ph\u1ea1m.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G87adxEeUomGC7xrjvslZE3mgxg\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>\u0110i\u1ec1n h\u1ed3 s\u01a1 c\u1ea9n th\u1eadn<\/strong>, tr\u00e1nh sai s\u00f3t khi\u1ebfn b\u1ecb t\u1eeb ch\u1ed1i.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Yluedgtk8oX4EKxX3LflPY26gEc\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>N\u1ebfu kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i ch\u1ee7 s\u1edf h\u1eefu<\/strong>, c\u1ea7n h\u1ee3p \u0111\u1ed3ng \u1ee7y quy\u1ec1n r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z2y6dpdboobOvex9LFnlhjWpgqf\" data-list=\"number\">\n<div><strong>Theo d\u00f5i email th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean<\/strong> \u0111\u1ec3 c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt t\u00ecnh tr\u1ea1ng x\u00e9t duy\u1ec7t.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TdTxdTk6MooP4rxKeU3lqYhVgUg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EUpJdyGikoMepSxtFapltg3XgGP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IxALdIlByoQG5wxhQVXlnqbugkc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>97\/7 L\u00ea Quang \u0110\u1ecbnh, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng 14, Qu\u1eadn B\u00ecnh Th\u1ea1nh, TP.HCM<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PyMSdc8UWoOkrZxjfMnlbP04gFb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CQBAdE33NoUMnSxzpJolsPvrg8d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Email: <\/strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QpYldDi4Eo8ZU5xADTmlhevogmb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Website: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jp15dW7plo8GwZxAF3Ml0Z1Zg0c\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>\u0110\u0103ng k\u00fd th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u tr\u00ean Shopee gi\u00fap b\u1ea3o v\u1ec7 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ch\u00ednh h\u00e3ng, t\u0103ng uy t\u00edn gian h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u01b0u ti\u00ean hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 b\u01b0\u1edbc quan tr\u1ecdng n\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n kinh doanh l\u00e2u d\u00e0i v\u00e0 x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng TM\u0110T n\u00e0y. C\u00f9ng Lemon Digital t\u00ecm hi\u1ec3u c\u00e1ch \u0111\u0103ng [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":4765,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[30,1],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-4456","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-kien-thuc-shopee","category-tin-tuc"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/4456","targetHint